# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Knowledge base: problems, symptom weights, and treatment as action templates.
# Tiers: free / low / chem.  Action = [template, param1, param2].
# Doses are typical label doses for India; the UI always tells the farmer to
# read the packet and to consult KVK / agriculture officer.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
